******************************** Data Format ***********************************

Column 01: Month
Column 02: Hour
Column 03: Frequency (MHz)
Column 04: D - Path distance (km)
Column 05: BMUF - Path basic MUF (MHz)
Column 06: E - Path Field Strength (dB(1uV/m))
Column 07: SNR - Median signal-to-noise ratio (dB)
Column 08: Free-space Field Strength 3 MW e.i.r.p. (dB(1uV/m)
